<title>USA: TABLE-PACCAR Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PACCAR Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in millions of dollars/a)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					 June 30	     June 30</p>
<p>				     1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
<p>Manufacturing and Parts</p>
<p>  Net Sales		   $1,588.7 $1,033.9 $3,032.1 $2,061.6</p>
<p> Financial Services Revenues  69.4     66.6    137.5    133.5</p>
<p>Income Before Taxes:</p>
<p> Manufacturing and Parts	89.5     59.4    152.4     92.0</p>
<p> Financial Services	     17.0     16.7     34.1     33.4</p>
<p> Investment Income		 5.5	5.9     10.6     12.1</p>
<p> Other, net			(1.2)	 .6	2.4	 .9</p>
<p>Total Income Before</p>
<p>  Income Taxes		   110.8     82.6    199.5    138.4</p>
<p> Income Taxes		     39.3     30.9     70.1     51.0</p>
<p> Net Income			 71.5     51.7    129.4   87.4/b</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share/c	 0.92     0.67     1.66     1.13</p>
<p>NOTES: (a) Except per share amount.</p>
<p>(b) Includes $11 million of after-tax costs to eliminate excess truck production capacity.</p>
<p>(c) Adjusted to reflect a two for one split effective on May 21, 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
